WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.610
- This week, we've asked our audience

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:03.910
to tell us their favorite
Kellyoke performances

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:04.960
from last season.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.510
So Vanessa in our house
seats has a special request.

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:09.040
What do you want to hear and why?

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.080
- Hi Kelly.
(Vanessa chuckles)

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.927
Today I'm requesting the song

00:00:13.927 --> 00:00:16.508
"Good as Hell" by Lizzo.
- Yes.

00:00:16.508 --> 00:00:18.880
- I just love this song so much.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:22.980
It's because it's about female
empowerment, loving yourself.

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:26.500
And I know it's helped me
through a whole lot of hard times

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.710
and also this phenomenal wonderful singer

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.385
just happens to be my baby sister.

00:00:32.385 --> 00:00:34.120
- What?
- Lizzo

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.774
- Are you serious?

00:00:35.774 --> 00:00:37.340
(audience clapping)
- I remember the first time

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:41.700
that I heard her do the
demo for "Good as Hell"

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:45.670
and I had never heard
her sing or rap like that

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.710
before in my life and I just knew

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:49.490
it was going to change our lives forever.

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:51.741
And I was right, it did.

00:00:51.741 --> 00:00:55.150
- Oh my gosh. I'm freaking out right now.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:56.970
Wait, so when did you know?

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.850
Cause I know she also plays instruments.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:00.890
So was she in the band kind of girl first?

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:02.550
And then all of a sudden
she just started singing

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:03.800
and rapping out of nowhere.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:07.363
- Oh yeah, she was always
in little rap groups.

00:01:07.363 --> 00:01:12.147
She was always making her own
version of Destiny's child.

00:01:12.147 --> 00:01:16.320
Yes. She was a band geek
as well, playing the flute.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:17.910
And then one day she just,

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:19.750
this beautiful voice came out of her

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:21.670
and it was the most amazing thing to see.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:25.010
- Oh my gosh, you have
an awesome little sister.

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:26.910
She is so fun to watch.

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:28.411
She's so talented.

00:01:28.411 --> 00:01:31.660
I tried to do it justice, but I love her

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:32.560
and I don't feel like I did,

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:34.097
but I love that you're requesting it.

00:01:34.097 --> 00:01:35.730
Thank you so much, Vanessa.

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:36.997
It's lovely to meet you.

00:01:36.997 --> 00:01:37.830
(audience clapping)

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.730
- Nice to meet you too. Thank you.

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:42.100
- All right and don't worry,
tell her we all envisioned

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.150
we were in Destiny's child at some point.

